        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze this email and classify it.\n\nSubject:\n{{ $json.Subject }}\n\nSender:\n{{ $json.From }}\n\nEmail:\n{{ $json.snippet }}\n\nChoose exactly one category:\nJOB\nCLIENT\nIMPORTANT\nNEWSLETTER\nSPAM\nOTHER\n\nChoose exactly one priority:\nHIGH\nMEDIUM\nLOW\n\nReturn these four fields:\ncategory\npriority\nsummary\naction_required\n\nRules:\n- JOB = jobs, internships, recruiters, interviews, or hiring opportunities\n- CLIENT = customer or business inquiries\n- IMPORTANT = messages that require attention\n- NEWSLETTER = newsletters, promotions, marketing, or subscriptions\n- SPAM = unwanted or suspicious messages\n- OTHER = anything that does not fit the above categories\n- Do not invent information.\n- Keep summary short.\n- action_required must be true or false.\n\nPriority rules:\n- HIGH: job/internship/interview opportunity, important client request, urgent deadline, or immediate action required.\n- MEDIUM: useful information that requires attention but is not urgent.\n- LOW: newsletters, general information, notifications, or messages requiring no action.\n- A genuine job or internship opportunity should normally be HIGH unless the email clearly indicates it is only informational.\n- If action_required is true for an important opportunity, prefer HIGH.",
